    "id": "lem:mandatory-final-pair-lower",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "There are a law \\(P_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\beta,d}(L,G,H,\\underline f,\\overline f)\\) and a constant \\(c_{\\mathrm{end}}>0\\), depending only on \\((L,G,H)\\), such that for every even \\(T\\ge32\\), every \\(B\\ge1\\), and every \\(\\pi\\in\\Pi_{T,B}\\),\n\\[\nT^{-1}\\mathbb E_{P_0,\\xi}[C_g(M_\\pi)-O_g(X)]\\ge \\frac{c_{\\mathrm{end}}}{T}.\n\\]",
